{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile settings using the scvi_n200 encoder, avgpool aggregation, and no image modality. The validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 score of 0.6275 suggest the scvi_n200 encoder may generalize its performance benefit from singleprofile settings to multiprofile configurations. However, the absence of direct comparisons to other encoders or aggregation methods in multiprofile settings leaves uncertainty about the role of these factors in the observed improvement."
}

